	\L_054b1:
	\L_053ed:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　JAPAN'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'      Nagasaki'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	SS 0:
	!VAR0516 : 497!
	\L_05409:
	\L_053ed:
	ZH 1:
	'A lone old man was standing on'
	R
	'a hill outside town.'
	\L_054da:
	ZH 1:
	'An unusually strong wind blew'
	R
	'mercilessly against his'
	R
	'withered body.'
	\L_054da:
	ZH 1:
	'But that didn’t stop him from'
	R
	'standing still in place as he'
	R
	'stared far off.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053b5:
	ZH 1:
	'Has the time come...? Has it'
	R
	'already been four years since'
	R
	'then...?'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053ed:
	ZH 1:
	'The old man’s whisper'
	R
	'disappeared in the wind.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053b5:
	ZH 1:
	'Fuuka.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053ed:
	ZH 1:
	'The old man called someone in'
	R
	'a clear voice.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	!VAR0516 : 100!
	\L_05479:
	\L_05425:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... Grandfather.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053ed:
	ZH 1:
	'The person that responded was'
	R
	'a beautiful girl that had at'
	R
	'some point begun standing'
	R
	'behind the old man.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053b5:
	ZH 1:
	'Fuuka... You know, I take it.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_05425:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, of course. It’s my duty.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053ed:
	ZH 1:
	'The girl named Fuuka smiled as'
	R
	'she responded. Her voice'
	R
	'showed no sign of indecision.'
	\L_054da:
	ZH 1:
	'The old man couldn’t look at'
	R
	'that without feeling a pain in'
	R
	'his chest.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053d1:
	ZH 1:
	'You have to throw away your'
	R
	'own life... A 15 year old'
	R
	'girl...'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_05425:
	ZH 1:
	'Grandfather?'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053b5:
	ZH 1:
	'Y-Yes... I know you’re aware,'
	R
	'but this is a year when Orochi'
	R
	'will awaken.'
	\L_054da:
	ZH 1:
	'If we don’t give Orochi a'
	R
	'sacrifice to return it to its'
	R
	'slumber...'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053ed:
	ZH 1:
	'The old man gulped.'
	R
	'Fuuka’s face also contorted'
	R
	'with distress.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_05425:
	ZH 1:
	'Its anger would sink JAPAN...'
	R
	'Isn’t that right, Grandfather?'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053b5:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s correct. That’s why'
	R
	'you...'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_05425:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m ready, Grandfather.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Fuuka smiled again.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_05425:
	ZH 1:
	'Four years ago, my big sister'
	R
	'Chiren commendably fulfilled'
	R
	'her duty.'
	\L_054da:
	ZH 1:
	'Now it’s my turn. The rest of'
	R
	'my life so far has been for'
	R
	'this.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053b5:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm... Three more months until'
	R
	'your body has been purified'
	R
	'enough to be an appropriate'
	R
	'sacrifice to Orochi.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_05425:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, Grandfather.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Fuuka responded without'
	R
	'hesitation, but the old man'
	R
	'notice something when looking'
	R
	'at her.'
	\L_054da:
	ZH 1:
	'Her trembling hands.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053d1:
	ZH 1:
	'It was decided...'
	R
	'Already decided...'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Though the old man knew that,'
	R
	'a feeling of despair still'
	R
	'spread in his heart.'
	\L_054da:
	ZH 1:
	'The old man has seen off many'
	R
	'people to be sacrificed, and'
	R
	'knew the futility of the'
	R
	'situation painfully well.'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_053d1:
	ZH 1:
	'Why must I feel this way every'
	R
	'time...?'
	\L_054da:
	\L_054cd:
	\L_05417:
	\L_05487:
